Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|testray.main.component.name|Mentions|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	Then User edit Password CP
		|password|password|
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userScreenName|usersn|

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: View Mention Via Blogs Entry
Priority: 5
	Given Page add
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	When Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Blogs|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And Mentions add Mention Via Blogs Entry
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
		|mentionsUserScreenName|usersn|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And BlogsNavigator goto PG
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	Then Mentions view Mention Tag Link
		|mentionsUserFullName|userfn userln|
		|mentionsUserScreenName|usersn|
Scenario: View Mention Via Blogs Entry Comment
Priority: 5
	Given Page add
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	When Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Blogs|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And Blogs add Entry
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And BlogsNavigator goto Entry PG
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And Pause at locator '3000'
	And Mentions add Mention Via Comments
		|entryComment|Comment mentioning|
		|mentionsUserFullName|userfn userln|
		|mentionsUserScreenName|usersn|
	Then Mentions view Comment Mention Tag Link
		|mentionsUserFullName|userfn userln|
		|mentionsUserScreenName|usersn|